# What NOT to upload as Cloud Build context.
#
# Without this the context includes infra/terraform/.terraform/, which holds a
# ~150 MB provider binary, plus the .git history and the .docx/.pptx artefacts.
# None of it is reachable from either Dockerfile, and all of it is paid for
# twice: once uploading and once again on every rebuild.
#
# Note this file REPLACES .gitignore as the exclusion source once it exists, so
# anything that must stay out has to be listed here even if git already ignores
# it.

.git/
.gitignore

# Terraform state, plugins and the provider binary.
infra/terraform/.terraform/
infra/terraform/*.tfstate
infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*
infra/terraform/terraform.tfvars
infra/terraform/*.auto.tfvars

# Node: the image runs `npm ci` itself, and a host-built tree is the wrong
# platform anyway.
**/node_modules/
web/dist/

# Python build and test detritus.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Generated documents. Large, binary, and not part of any image.
*.docx
*.pptx
*.xlsx
docs/diagrams/*.png
